1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:00,928
This 172-foot bomber

2
00:00:00,928 --> 00:00:01,776
weighs eighty tons,

3
00:00:01,776 --> 00:00:02,275
yet on radar

4
00:00:02,275 --> 00:00:02,724
it shrinks

5
00:00:02,724 --> 00:00:03,437
to a bumblebee.

6
00:00:03,750 --> 00:00:04,475
Normal jets bounce

7
00:00:04,485 --> 00:00:05,390
radar straight back,

8
00:00:05,429 --> 00:00:06,246
but stealth wings use

9
00:00:06,256 --> 00:00:07,348
flat origami angles

10
00:00:07,358 --> 00:00:08,692
that deflect
waves sideways.

11
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:09,696
Even the engines

12
00:00:09,708 --> 00:00:10,296
stay hidden,

13
00:00:10,355 --> 00:00:11,073
deep S-shaped

14
00:00:11,108 --> 00:00:11,956
air tunnels bury

15
00:00:11,968 --> 00:00:13,074
the spinning
metal blades

16
00:00:13,097 --> 00:00:14,498
so radar gets trapped

17
00:00:14,510 --> 00:00:15,556
and dies inside.

18
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:16,909
Then its dark carbon

19
00:00:16,921 --> 00:00:18,256
skin swallows leftover

20
00:00:18,268 --> 00:00:19,530
waves as tiny heat,

21
00:00:19,651 --> 00:00:20,513
shrinking the echo

22
00:00:20,525 --> 00:00:21,251
to a bumblebee.

23
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:23,049
It isn't
sci-fi cloaking,

24
00:00:23,071 --> 00:00:23,887
just tilted mirrors

25
00:00:23,898 --> 00:00:24,848
scattering every pulse

26
00:00:24,860 --> 00:00:25,733
away from the dish.

27
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:26,741
So by the time

28
00:00:26,801 --> 00:00:28,027
enemies finally
spot it,

29
00:00:28,051 --> 00:00:28,549
the bomber

30
00:00:28,561 --> 00:00:29,544
is already gone.
